## Scope

Carry ticket 0727's local work that is independent of Zotero PR #6054.
The PR outcome and real Add-ons UI control belong to 0812.

## Work

- Measure whether `pendingOperations` and `PENDING_UNINSTALL` remain visible
  after a same-session replacement through the Add-ons window. Only if that
  state can be observed in time, build and test a startup warning before the
  queued deletion; do not ship a guard that cannot fire.
- Resolve the two local defects 0727 logged on 2026-09-14: an unshowable
  `confirmEx` read as consent, and a stale removed-instance window after a
  healthy reinstall. Give each a reproducible control before changing code.

## Exit criteria

Each local safeguard has a measured verdict and any necessary fix has a
positive and negative control. The ticket records why a proposed guard is
infeasible if the required host state is not observable.
